<title>UK: Bunzl seals American Filtrona buy.</title>
<headline>Bunzl seals American Filtrona buy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>British plastics group Bunzl Plc said on Wednesday it had signed a definitive deal to buy American Filtrona Corp for $178 million cash, as previously agreed.</p>
<p>Earlier this month, Bunzl said it had signed a letter of intent to buy the bonded fibres and plastics company for $46.52 per share.</p>
<p>Bunzl's shares firmed 1.5p to 191.5 by 0855 GMT. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
